# 🌦️ Weather-Aware Delivery Delay System

## 📌 Overview
This project checks weather conditions for delivery cities and flags potential delays using the OpenWeatherMap API.

---

## 🚀 Features
- Parallel API fetching using Promise.all
- Weather-based delay detection (Rain, Snow, Extreme)
- AI-generated apology messages
- Error handling for invalid cities
- Secure API key handling using .env

---

